    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, ὁ, dub. sens., perh. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eager</i>, 
